OL,3,AReported assaults on Britain's rail
OL,4,Aservices rise substantially
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere has been an increase in reports
OL,7,Fof violent incidents and harassment on
OL,8,Frail services across Britain, new
OL,9,Ffigures show.
OL,11,FReported assaults, including physical
OL,12,Fand verbal, "rose substantially" in the
OL,13,Fyear to March 2026 compared to the
OL,14,Fprevious year, according to the
OL,15,Fregulator responsible, the Office of
OL,16,FRail and Road (ORR).
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
