OL,3,AReported assaults on Britain's rail
OL,4,Aservices rise substantially
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn total 13,464 assaults against
OL,7,Fpassengers and members of the public
OL,8,Fwere recorded on the mainline railway,
OL,9,Fup 36% and the highest number recorded
OL,10,Fsince the series began in 2004.The
OL,11,Ffigures do not reflect incidents in
OL,12,FNorthern Ireland.
OL,14,FThe ORR said the rise was "concerning"
OL,15,Fand that it was working with the
OL,16,Findustry to address the problem.
